<title>BRAZIL: Eletrobras Q1 net rises to 775 mln reais.</title>
<headline>Eletrobras Q1 net rises to 775 mln reais.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian federal electrical power holding Eletrobras released the following preliminary first-quarter results.</p>
<p>		    Q1 1997	   Q1 1996</p>
<p>Net Profit	775 million	   769 million</p>
<p>Share Net	   14.41	     14.31</p>
<p>Note: All figures are in Brazilian reais and share net is per 1,000 shares.</p>
<p>An Eletrobras spokesman said he could not provide further details on the company's first-quarter results.</p>
<p>((--James Craig, Brasilia newsroom 5561 2230358))</p>
</text>
